.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt GETCONF 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm getconf
.Nd query POSIX configuration values
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl a
.Op Ar name ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the value of each
.Ar name .
The bounded table includes
.Ql ARG_MAX ,
.Ql PAGESIZE ,
.Ql PAGE_SIZE ,
.Ql _POSIX_VERSION ,
.Ql _POSIX_ARG_MAX ,
.Ql _POSIX_CHOWN_RESTRICTED ,
.Ql _POSIX_NAME_MAX ,
.Ql _POSIX_PATH_MAX ,
.Ql _POSIX_PIPE_BUF
and
.Ql _POSIX_VDISABLE .
Unsupported names are reported and exit 1; values are never invented.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a , Fl -all
Print every supported
.Ar name
and value.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
An unknown variable exits 1.
A usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr env 1 ,
.Xr limits 3
.Sh STANDARDS
IEEE Std 1003.1-2024
.Pq POSIX.1-2024 .
